Google Forms:  
Creating quizzes with Google Forms helped me design interactive assessments on digital literacy topics.
It taught me how to structure questions clearly, use multiple formats (MCQs, short answers), and analyze responses efficiently through automatic summaries.

CodeChef:  
Using CodeChef allowed me to practice competitive programming and improve my problem‑solving skills.
It gave me exposure to timed challenges, algorithmic thinking, and a platform to showcase coding progress as part of my digital portfolio.
